  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGGI PHASE II OF THE COLOMBIA GREEN GROWTH PROGRAM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative builds upon results from Phase I of the Program and aims to improve institutional effectiveness to reduce deforestation and promote sustainable land use. The program will facilitate the design and scale up of initiatives and instruments related to sustainable productive systems and restoration. Key institutions at the national level will be supported. Actions at the subnational level will be focused  in four Departments and in the jurisdiction of one of the Regional Environmental Authorities of the Amazonia (CORPOAMAZONIA). GGGI program will promote women&#xb4;s empowerment and gender mainstreaming along the different components of the Program. Women entrepreneurs will be supported to accelerate projects ideas related with forestry, agriculture, nature based tourism and/or bio economy.  At least one investment Project will be certified with W+ Standards.</narrative>
  </description>
